# NHIT File Process — track Python source only.
#
# This repo is scripts-only in git. Keep local:
#   - VRN / lifecycle CSV & Excel inputs (Exempt Query/Daroda_lc_vrn_files/, lcy/, etc.)
#   - Merge & normalization outputs (*.csv, normalized_and_merged_*.csv)
#   - Pass file splits (pass_files/, pass_output/)
#   - Portal upload/process folders (Portal/File_Process/)
#   - Rates / working Excel (mudi_mp.xlsx, Bjp_LT.xlsx, local code - plaza wise.xlsx)
#   - Secrets (.env)

# --- Track only Python (+ minimal repo metadata) ---
*
!*/
!**/*.py
!.gitignore
!.env.example

# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Excel (all common formats + lock files) ---
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.xltx
*.xltm
~$*.xls*
~$*.xlsx

# --- Archives ---
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.gz

# --- Tabular / data outputs ---
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.feather

# --- Cache & bytecode ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python

.cache/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/

# --- Logs & OS junk ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Merge / convert temp dirs (merge_files.py, Life_cycle_merge*.py) ---
life_cycle_merge_*/

# --- Portal runtime data (uploads, merged outputs, lookup results) ---
Portal/File_Process/

# --- Local input/output folders (scripts read/write here; not versioned) ---
Exempt Query/Daroda_lc_vrn_files/
Exempt Query/pass_files/
Exempt Query/pass_output/
Exempt Query/lcy/
valid invalid script/pullur valid invalid output/
Life Cycle Report/
